// shin for VS Code: helix's shin theme (~/.config/helix/themes/shin.toml) for the
// code, ghostty's colors for the terminal. UI is black, greys and wine; the other
// hues only show up in syntax, diffs and diagnostics.
//   bg #000000  bg-alt #1e1e1e  surface #2a2a2a  line #393939
//   fg #e9e9e9  fg-dim #cfcfcf  muted #989898    faint #5c5c5c
//   wine #8c1625  wine-bright #cb4d66  wine-deep #750017  wine-mid #a8304a  rose #d5909e
//   green #a2ff33  yellow #ffb31a  blue #668aff  magenta #d95cff  cyan #1aceff
